<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s356S">Sutra also <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s356w10">mentions</span> the &quot;<span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s356w9">eight</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s356w8">expressions</span> of a <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s356w7">realized person</span>&quot;--<span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s356w3">four</span> where you <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s356p2">say</span> &quot;I did <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s356w2">see</span> it&quot; <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s356p1">about</span> things you really did <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s356w1">see</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s356p3">and so on</span>; <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s356w6">four</span> where you <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s356p7">say</span> &quot;I did<span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s356p6">n&#x27;t</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s356w5">see</span> it&quot; <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s356p5">about</span> things you really did<span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s356p4">n&#x27;t</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s356w4">see</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s356p8">and such</span>. Regarding these two sets of eight, one may <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s356f2">ask</span> for a more detailed description of the basic <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s356w13">four</span>: <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s356f1">what it is</span> to be &quot;something <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s356w11">seen</span>,&quot; &quot;something <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s356w12">heard</span>,&quot; <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s356p9">and so on</span>. <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s356f3">That which is</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s356w24">experienced</span> by <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s356w15">consciousness</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s356p10">of</span> the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s356w14">eye</span>, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s356w17">consciousness</span> of the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s356w16">ear</span>, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s356w19">consciousness</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s356p11">of</span> the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s356w18">thought</span>, <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s356p12">and</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s356p13">by</span> the other <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s356w23">three</span> kinds of consciousness (those of <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s356w20">nose</span>, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s356w21">tongue</span>, and <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s356w22">body</span>) <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s356f5">represents</span> <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s356f4">respectively</span> what is <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s356w25">seen</span>, what is <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s356w26">heard</span>, what is <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s356w27">known</span>, <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s356p14">and</span> also what is <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s356w28">sensed</span>. We turn next to a description of the six &quot;branch&quot; non-virtues. 78 Six &quot;Branch&quot; Non-Virtues</span>
